              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio Yeroboamu owe khabili akhola, ne bunyindaafu bwewe nga ne apana, mala akobosia khu Isiraeli chingoba cha Damasika ne Hamati, choosi chichaba cha Yuda, bioosi biaandikwa mu sitabu sie babaami ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu owe Khabili afwa mala asiikhwa mu biliindwa bie babaami ba Isiraeli. Ne omusoleeli wewe Sakaria amiisibwa mu bweyaangu bwewe aba omwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
